  "body": "Positioned in the sought-after Millwater community, 25B Blake Greens presents an appealing blend of contemporary comfort, generous proportions and a beautifully leafy urban outlook. Overlooking established trees, this well-appointed three-bedroom home showcases the quality craftsmanship of reputable builder, Horncastle. With thoughtfully designed interiors, excellent storage, double glazing throughout and the Orewa Estuary Walk right on your doorstep, this is a home that effortlessly balances relaxed living with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\n- Three generously proportioned bedrooms, each complete with wardrobes.\r\n- Spacious master bedroom featuring a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\n- Separate main bathroom, complemented by the master ensuite.\r\n- Beautiful urban outlook with leafy views across the surrounding trees.\r\n- Double glazing throughout and a heat pump for year-round comfort.\r\n- Excellent attic storage, providing ample room for belongings.\r\n- Zoned for Silverdale School and Orewa College.\r\n- Conveniently located just minutes from Silverdale Shopping Centre, Millwater shops and Orewa Town Centre.\r\n- Enjoy the Orewa Estuary Walk right on your doorstep, perfect for peaceful strolls and embracing the natural surroundings.\r\n\r\nWith the owner relocating to be closer to family, an exciting opportunity now presents itself for the next fortunate owner to secure this appealing Millwater residence. Whether you are seeking a refined lock-and-leave lifestyle, a comfortable home with generous proportions or a peaceful retreat close to everyday amenities, 25B Blake Greens deserves your attention. Located centrally to all amenities, this is a lifestyle well worth embracing.",
